  "id": "robot",
  "term": "robot",
  "definition": "In this social-psychology context, a robot is a machine used in human interaction that can display facial expressions to communicate emotion. Social robots may use digital or anthropomorphic facial features, and changes in those features, such as facial color lightness, can alter how emotionally arousing the robot appears.",
